</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/b9c1de82-605c-11f1-b02d-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-06-04T060110Z-1398126609-RC2QMAA60CEX-RTRMADP-3-TAIWAN-CHINA-MISSILES.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/b9c1de82-605c-11f1-b02d-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-06-04T060110Z-1398126609-RC2QMAA60CEX-RTRMADP-3-TAIWAN-CHINA-MISSILES.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">49e4b288-85aa-11f1-81d5-016e709e9f17</guid><pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 08:50:23 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/b9c1de82-605c-11f1-b02d-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-06-04T060110Z-1398126609-RC2QMAA60CEX-RTRMADP-3-TAIWAN-CHINA-MISSILES.jpg">REUTERS - Tyrone Siu</source><dc:creator>台北特约记者 陈筱涵</dc:creator></item><item><category>港台</category><title>称为配合香港国安法 台湾有物流公司拒运"违法书籍"兼要求备书单审查</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E6%B8%AF%E6%BE%B3%E5%8F%B0/20260722-%E7%A7%B0%E4%B8%BA%E9%85%8D%E5%90%88%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%89%E6%B3%95-%E5%8F%B0%E6%B9%BE%E6%9C%89%E7%89%A9%E6%B5%81%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%E6%8B%92%E8%BF%90%E8%BF%9D%E6%B3%95%E4%B9%A6%E7%B1%8D%E5%85%BC%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E5%A4%87%E4%B9%A6%E5%8D%95%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5</link><description>
